@Rivulus_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219
@projectId = coloque-o-id-do-projeto-aqui
@token = coloque-o-token-aqui

### Autenticar usuário
POST {{Rivulus_HostAddress}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seu-email@example.com",
  "password": "sua-senha"
}

### Consultar tarefas paginadas de um projeto
GET {{Rivulus_HostAddress}}/api/TodoTask/project/{{projectId}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar a segunda página
GET {{Rivulus_HostAddress}}/api/TodoTask/project/{{projectId}}?page=2&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
